      "minimal_entry": "cap73.sac-trust.p30-xlm-transfer-creates-account-envelope",
      "reproduce": "shapekit harness run --chain cap73.sac-trust.p30 --network testnet --adapter \"adapters/bin/etl-adapter --commit 2b24ec89ddce7fc0beb7795de982c93e6895eaf3\"",
      "status": "draft",
      "draft": "candidate/findings/issues/stellar-etl-E2.md",
      "cause": "An XLM transfer through the native asset contract to an account that does not exist creates it (CAP-73). transformEffects writes account_debited and account_credited for the transfer event (addInvokeHostFunctionEffects, internal/transform/effects.go L1326-L1440 at 2b24ec89) but account_created only for a CreateAccount operation (addAccountCreatedEffects, L411-L437), so the new account has no account_created effect. The source does not say whether this is intended.",
